Package: bedrocktrader
Title: Retrieve Minecraft Bedrock Villager Trade Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person('Rento', 'Saijo', email = 'rentosaijo0527@gmail.com', role = c('aut', 'cre', 'cph'), comment = c(ORCID = '0009-0008-4919-7349'))
Description: Retrieves official vanilla Minecraft Bedrock villager trade
    tables from versioned Mojang releases and represents their tier, group,
    candidate, item-choice, function, and filter structure in R. Each result
    records the exact upstream version, Git commit, source path, and blob
    identifier used.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl,
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    tibble
URL: https://rentosaijo.github.io/bedrocktrader/, https://github.com/RentoSaijo/bedrocktrader
BugReports: https://github.com/RentoSaijo/bedrocktrader/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
